              "value": "23 October, 1952",
              "source_ids": [
                "IKWEB-1251841:L39"
              ]
            },
            "proceeding": {
              "value": "Civil Appeal No. 73 of 1950",
              "source_ids": [
                "IKWEB-1251841:L120"
              ]
            }
          },
          "qualifications": [
            {
              "type": "CONDITION",
              "content": {
                "value": "Wazir Narain Singh executed the 14th August, 1926, a mortgage of Gadi Sirampur in favour of the Manager of the Court of Wards in charge of the plaintiff's estate during his minority to secure repayment of a sum of Rs. 1,47,000 and out of the same satisfied the dues of the Bank and the sale in favour of the Ban was accordingly set aside.",
